    "summaryDescription": "\"Chaiman travels the legnth and breath of the whole country\", a poster reproduction of  an ink painting by Li Qi, and published by People's Publishing House in October 1961. The portrait is one of the most popular images of Mao in China. It depicts Mao in white shirt resting one arm on his waist and holding a straw-hat in the other hand. The inscription at the upper-right corner is a folk-style eulogistic poem, written by Guo Moruo.",
